      equipment: '36-card deck.',
      dealing: '1. Each player is dealt 6 cards.\n2. One card is placed FACE-DOWN in the center.\n3. The next card is placed FACE-UP on top of it (The Initial Trump Suit).\n4. The stock is placed on top of these two cards.',
    },
    turnFlow: '1. Standard Play: Follow Podkidnoy rules (Attacking, Defending, Throw-ins).\n2. Initial Trump: Use the face-up card suit for the first phase.\n3. The Shift: When the stock is empty, the player who draws the LAST (face-down) card reveals it.\n4. New Reality: The suit of that final card IMMEDIATELY becomes the new trump suit for the rest of the game.',
